<title>NAMIBIA: Rio Tinto's Rossing appoints new manager.</title>
<headline>Rio Tinto's Rossing appoints new manager.</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio Tinto's Rossing Uranium Ltd in Namibia has appointed a new general manager for its mine with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Werner Haymann has extensive mining experience with CRA, the Australian component of Rossing's parent company the Rio Tinto Zinc-ConReo Zinc Australia group, Rossing said.</p>
<p>Haymann, 50, has also been mining manager and general manager at Blair Athol Coal in Australia.</p>
<p>Rossing produced 2,336 tonnes of uranium in 1995.</p>
